<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Elandsrand, Deelkraal talks continue.</title>
<headline>Elandsrand, Deelkraal talks continue.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elandsrand Gold Mining Co and Deelkraal Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Friday that talks between the two mines where continuing and shareholders should continue to exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
